<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: right; margin: 0"><B>EXHIBIT 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>HOUSE LEASING CONTRACT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Lessor (hereinafter referred to as Party A):</B>
Ke Chen</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Lessor&rsquo;s ID Number:</B> [***]</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Lessee (hereinafter referred to as Party B):</B>
Chengdu Shanyou HVAC Engineering Co., Ltd. <B>Lessee&rsquo;s Business License No.:</B> [***]</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">In accordance with the <I>Contract Law of the People&rsquo;s
Republic of China</I> and relevant laws and regulations, Party A and Party B enter into this Contract on the basis of equality and voluntariness
concerning Party A leasing the Premises to Party B and Party B renting the Premises from Party A.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 1 Premises Information</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">The Premises leased by Party A to Party B is located
at No.477 Wanxing Road, Wuhou District, Chengdu, with a construction area of 436.16 square meters, specifically Rooms 1110-1117, 11th
Floor, Unit 1, Building 7, Longxi Center.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 2 Document Submission</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">Party A shall provide documents including the real
estate ownership certificate, the <I>House Purchase Contract</I> signed with the property developer, or other valid certificates proving
the right to lease, as well as identity documents. Party B shall provide its identity certification documents. Both parties may keep copies
of the other party&rsquo;s documents after verification. All copies shall be used solely for this lease.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 3 Lease Term and Purpose</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><B></B></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 18pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 18pt; font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">1.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The lease term totals 60 months, commencing on September 1, 2026 and expiring on August 31, 2031 (August 2026 is a rent-free period).</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><B></B>&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">If Party B intends to renew the lease, it shall notify Party A 15 days prior to the expiration of the
lease term, and both parties shall sign a new leasing contract.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">3.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party B shall use the Premises solely for office purposes and shall not carry out business activities
in violation of national laws and regulations. Upon expiry of the lease term, if Party A continues to lease out the Premises, Party B
shall have the priority to rent it.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 4 Rent and Payment Terms</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">1.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The monthly rent is RMB Twenty-Four Thousand Only (&yen;24,000.00). Rent shall be paid on a quarterly
basis. Party B shall pay the rent to Party A by the 1st day of each payment period. In the lease term, any rent fluctuation caused by
market price changes shall be subject to separate negotiation between both parties.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party B shall pay the first-period rent of RMB Seventy-Two Thousand Only (&yen;72,000.00) on or before
September 1, 2026.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">3.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party A&rsquo;s bank account for receiving payments: Bank of Deposit: Industrial and Commercial Bank of
China, Chengdu Binjiang Sub-branch Business Office Account Name: Ke Chen Bank Account No.: [***]</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 2pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 5 Lease Deposit</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">1.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party B shall pay a lease deposit of RMB Twenty-Four Thousand Only (&yen;24,000.00) to Party A on or before
September 1, 2026.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Upon expiry of the lease term if Party B does not renew the lease, the lease deposit shall be fully refunded
(interest-free) to Party A after deducting expenses and rent payable by Party B, or compensation for breach of contract for which Party
B is liable under this Contract.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 6 Premises Hand-over and Expense Liability</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">1.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party A shall hand over the Premises to Party B for use on September 1, 2026. Upon hand-over, Party A
shall settle all outstanding debts and complete hand-over formalities. Hand-over shall be deemed completed once both parties inspect,
sign for confirmation and hand over the Premises keys.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">During the lease term, property management fees, water and electricity charges, telephone fees, internet
access fees, cable TV fees, gas fees, cleaning fees, parking fees and all other miscellaneous expenses arising from the use of the Premises
shall be borne by Party B. For any expenses not listed herein, both parties may negotiate and specify them in the remarks of this Contract
or sign a supplementary agreement separately.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 7 Sub-leasing</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">During the lease term, Party B shall not sub-lease
part or all of the Premises to any third party (except with the prior written consent of Party A; provided that the sub-lease term shall
not exceed the lease term stipulated in this Contract). If Party B conducts unauthorized sub-leasing, Party A has the right to terminate
this Contract and forfeit the full lease deposit. Party B shall also compensate for any losses incurred to Party A arising from such sub-leasing.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 8 Rights and Obligations of Both Parties</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">1.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party A shall ensure that the Premises and its attached facilities delivered are fit for the lease purpose
and meet safety requirements under applicable national laws, regulations and rules. Party B shall use the Premises and its attached facilities
in a reasonable manner.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">During the lease term, Party B shall not alter the structure or purpose of the Premises without authorization.
Otherwise, Party A has the right to forfeit the lease deposit and unilaterally terminate this Contract. If either Party A or Party B intends
to reconstruct, expand or renovate the Premises, a separate written agreement shall be signed by both parties in compliance with applicable
laws.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">3.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">It shall constitute a breach of contract by Party B if Party B deliberately defaults on rent payment,
fails to pay relevant fees or surrenders the Premises in advance. Party A is entitled to forfeit the lease deposit. If Party A unilaterally
terminates this Contract after receiving the lease deposit or otherwise breaches this Contract, it shall constitute a breach of contract
by Party A, and Party B may demand Party A to refund double the lease deposit.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">4.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Upon termination or rescission of this Contract, Party A has the right to take back the Premises. Party
B shall move out unconditionally within 5 days. If Party B refuses to return the keys and vacate the Premises, Party A may enter the Premises
in the presence of property management staff, and all articles left in the Premises shall be deemed abandoned by Party B.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">5.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Party B has the right to request Party A to issue receipts for all payments received by Party A. Bank
transfer slips may serve as proof of payment.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 18pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 18pt">6.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">If this Contract cannot be performed due to force majeure (unforeseeable, unavoidable and insurmountable
events), this Contract shall be automatically terminated. Neither party shall be liable to the other. Party A shall refund the lease deposit
(interest-free) to Party B within three days.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt; margin: 0 0 0 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt"></P>

