    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 9 Other Agreements</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">Within the five-year lease term under this Contract,
if either party intends to terminate the lease in advance, it shall notify the other party one month in advance. If Party A fails to give
such notice on time, Party A shall pay double the lease deposit as compensation to Party B. If Party B fails to give such notice on time,
the lease deposit shall be forfeited.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>Clause 10</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">This Contract is made in two counterparts, each of
which shall have equal legal effect and shall take effect upon signature / seal by both parties. Any dispute arising out of or in connection
with this Contract may be submitted to the people&rsquo;s court at the location of the Premises for litigation.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

